    "_****Usecase Template****_\n",
    "  <div class=\"usecase-title\">{usecase Name}</div>\n",
    "\n",
    "<div class=\"usecase-authors\"><b>Authored by: </b> {Author/s}</div>\n",
    "<div class=\"usecase-date\"><b>Date Created: </b> {Trimester #, YYYY}</div>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<div class=\"usecase-duration\"><b>Time to Complete:</b> {90} mins</div>\n",
    "\n",
    "<div class=\"usecase-level-skill\">\n",
    "    <div class=\"usecase-level\"><b>Level: </b>{Intermediate}</div>\n",
    "    <div class=\"usecase-skill\"><b>Pre-requisite Skills: </b>{Python, and add any more skills needed/ not skills that will be taught throughout this use case}</div>\n",
    "</div>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<div id=\"scenario\" class=\"usecase-section-header\"><b>Scenario</b></div>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "{Using User Story format, write a description of the problem you are trying to solve for this usecase.}"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<div id=\"what-this-teaches\" class=\"usecase-section-header\"><b>What this usecase will teach you</b></div>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<div class=\"usecase-heading-description\">{Description or list of what this usecase will teach the user.}</div>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<div id=\"background\" class=\"usecase-section-header\"><b>Background</b></div>"
