    "</div>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<div class=\"usecase-contents\"><b>Contents</b></div>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "_Update this list to match the actual numbered headings in your notebook once your content is finalised. Use anchor tags pointing to your section `id`s to make them clickable (see Style Guide Reference for details)._\n",
    "\n",
    "<div class=\"usecase-contents\">\n",
    "\n",
    "1. <a href=\"#section-1\">{Your first analysis section heading}</a>\n",
    "2. <a href=\"#section-2\">{Your next analysis section heading}</a>\n",
    "3. <a href=\"#section-3\">{Your next analysis section heading}</a>\n",
    "4. <a href=\"#section-4\">{Your next analysis section heading}</a>\n",
    "5. <a href=\"#section-5\">{Your next analysis section heading}</a>\n",
    "  - 5.1. <a href=\"#subsection-5-1\">{Subsection}</a>\n",
    "6. <a href=\"#section-6\">{Your next analysis section heading}</a>\n",
    "\n",
    "</div>"
   ]
  },
  {
